Subject: Compare protobuf messages through their supported test API

SONiC already selects protobuf 1.36.11. The old ygot test comparers inspect
protobuf implementation state, which prevents the shared owner's original
suite from testing that dependency combination. Use standard protocmp for
gNMI messages and adapt custom JSON comparisons to its message form.
Preserve the exported JSONIETFComparer signature and verify that JSON-IETF
and string oneofs remain distinct. No dependency version changes are made.

Origin: Backport of openconfig/ygot PR #377's testcmp/testutil changes,
with SONiC adaptations and regressions preserving the v0.7.1 public API:
https://github.com/openconfig/ygot/pull/377

